        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Focused on the future of the indirect sales channels – a specialist market where B2B technology companies actively seek alliances with channel partners – we provide expert analyst, intelligence and advisory services, that inform vendors’ go-to-market strategies and deliver specialist information, insight and content to channel professionals.",
        "start_character": 38671,
        "end_character": 39014
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to pursuing these organic growth opportunities, we believe we are positioned to expand our businesses and market presence by opportunistically acquiring complementary businesses that add additional data, audiences, content and go-to-market and/or new capabilities that further differentiate our product offerings.",
        "start_character": 4153,
        "end_character": 4478
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "International expansion: We estimate that technology sellers based outside the United States represent approximately 40% of the global market opportunity for the products we offer.",
        "start_character": 2345,
        "end_character": 2525
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "More Efficient and Effective Sales Outreach: We are a leading distributor of B2B enterprise technology white papers, webcasts, videocasts, virtual events and podcasts, offering technology vendors the opportunity to educate and influence technology buyers during the research process, prior to any interaction with sales teams.",
        "start_character": 34953,
        "end_character": 35279
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our immediate and prospective future clients are deeply involved in that cycle, and the products we offer are designed to optimize our clients’ ability to address the opportunities presented by this cycle.",
        "start_character": 5989,
        "end_character": 6194
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our newly expanded scale and cashflows are expected to provide significant capacity for new product investment as we compete in the Intelligence and Advisory, Brand and Content, and Demand and Intent markets.",
        "start_character": 14526,
        "end_character": 14734
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Specialist Technology Research: Through the Omdia brand, which now incorporates the formerly separate specialist brands Canalys, Wards Intelligence and Enterprise Strategy Group, we provide research and intelligence services to technology providers based on expert analysis and data-driven intelligence and reports.",
        "start_character": 21111,
        "end_character": 21426
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The new products we intend to develop include audience focused services, such as new content websites, newsletters, and research, which are designed to expand and enrich B2B audiences, and go-to-market products and services intended to accelerate client time to market and to revenue, including Intelligence & Advisory, Brand & Content and Intent & Demand.",
        "start_character": 3478,
        "end_character": 3834
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our leading brands and capabilities, we deliver market insights, facilitate meaningful connections, and offer digital demand generation services for those working with transformative and future technologies and in the field of information management.",
        "start_character": 36609,
        "end_character": 36867
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To our clients, we offer expert-led, data-driven, digitally-enabled products that service the product lifecycle from R&D to ROI, which we believe makes us a strategic partner to many of the technology industry’s largest companies and its most successful, fastest and most innovative players, accelerating time to market and to revenue.",
        "start_character": 16829,
        "end_character": 17164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are home to a comprehensive suite of products serving the channel ecosystem, with a broad reach across technology advisors/agents, value-added resellers, solution providers, managed service providers, independent software vendors and consultants.",
        "start_character": 38421,
        "end_character": 38670
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102183-17ed667f79ee3790",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that investment in innovation and growth in the research and development (“R&D”) budgets of our clients provides a leading indicator of demand for our products and services.",
